    <section id="how">
      <p class="sec__t">Process</p>
      <h2>what happens after you pay</h2>
      <div class="steps bd">
        <div class="step"><b>day 1</b><p>You send the link and pay through Stripe. No call needed to start.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><b>day 7</b><p>The concept lands in your inbox. You react. If it is wrong, you keep the file and we shake hands.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><b>week 2 to 5</b><p>The rest gets designed and built in Webflow or Framer, then handed over.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="warm">
      <p class="sec__t">Pricing</p>
      <h2>3 ways to start</h2>
      <div class="tiers bd">

        <div class="tier tier--hi">
          <div>
            <h3>concept in 7 days</h3>
            <p class="tier__p">$1,499</p>
            <button class="tier__cta" data-scroll="concepts" type="button">see what we already made</button>
          </div>
          <div class="tier__r">
            <p>You pay for 1 page and see the direction before committing to a project. Send the website, we redesign the homepage from scratch. No call, no brief, no moodboard.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>1 homepage direction in Figma, hero plus 3 sections</li>
              <li>Animated scroll preview, not a flat mockup</li>
              <li>Credited toward the full redesign within 60 days</li>
              <li>Yours to keep and build however you want</li>
              <li>No revisions, it is a fixed concept</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <div>
            <h3>trial week</h3>
            <p class="tier__p">$2,499</p>
            <a class="tier__cta" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Trial%20week">book a week ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tier__r">
            <p>For when you already know what needs doing. Pick whatever is on fire and we spend the week on it.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Design, build, or both</li>
              <li>Private Slack channel from day 1</li>
              <li>Daily output, not a weekly report</li>
              <li>Ends on Friday, no notice period</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <div>
            <h3>a month</h3>
            <p class="tier__p">$7,899</p>
            <a class="tier__cta" href="mailto:adam@unroot.design?subject=Monthly%20project">discuss a month ↗</a>
          </div>
          <div class="tier__r">
            <p>The full thing. A landing page designed and built, or a whole website designed, inside 4 weeks.</p>
            <ul>
              <li>1 senior designer, 1 senior developer, art direction</li>
              <li>We vibe code the build, which is why a month is enough</li>
              <li>Unlimited requests inside the month</li>
              <li>Pause or stop before the next block starts</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reviews">
      <p class="sec__t">Proof</p>
      <h2>what clients say</h2>
      <div class="slider bd">
