    <span class="q__who"><img src="/homepage/img/av-tasnia.jpg" alt="Tasnia Huque" loading="lazy"><span><b>Tasnia Huque</b><s>Principal at Javelin VP</s></span></span>
    <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68811a779569d1770b673aba" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="q__tp">verified on Trustpilot <i>&#8599;</i></a>
  </footer>
