    <span class="q__who"><img src="/homepage/img/av-adrian.jpg" alt="Adrian Canoso" loading="lazy"><span><b>Adrian Canoso</b><s>CEO and Co-Founder at Ambient Dreamie</s></span></span>
    <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68dad10cbf77717f3c8e7895" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="q__tp">verified on Trustpilot <i>&#8599;</i></a>
