    <span class="q__who"><img src="/homepage/img/av-jonah.jpg" alt="Jonah Neuss" loading="lazy"><span><b>Jonah Neuss</b><s>Wow House Studio</s></span></span>
    <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/reviews/68800cfb2b8ce173b31d4fce" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="q__tp">verified on Trustpilot <i>&#8599;</i></a>
