    <span class="q__who"><img src="/homepage/img/av-rokas.jpg" alt="Rokas Judickas" loading="lazy"><span><b>Rokas Judickas</b><s>Founding designer at Sintra.ai</s></span></span>

  </footer>
</article></div>
