      <h2>5 people in warsaw</h2>
      <div class="team bd"><div class="tm"><span class="tm__a" style="--a:var(--violet)">AD</span>
  <span class="tm__t"><b>Adam</b><s>design + projects</s></span></div><div class="tm"><span class="tm__a" style="--a:var(--pink)">EU</span>
  <span class="tm__t"><b>Eugenia</b><s>senior design</s></span></div><div class="tm"><span class="tm__a" style="--a:var(--cream)">AL</span>
